---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Depends wiring: get_service builds a fresh CaseService per request, get_repo is
// @lru_cache so ONE repository (holding the dict) is shared by all of them.
const W = 900, H = 340;
const reqs = [
  { x: 70, n: { en: 'request 1', vi: 'request 1' } },
  { x: 340, n: { en: 'request 2', vi: 'request 2' } },
  { x: 610, n: { en: 'request 3', vi: 'request 3' } },
];
---
<figure class="bep4f">
  <div class="bep4f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three requests each get their own fresh CaseService, built per request. All three point down to one shared repository, built once by get_repo with lru_cache, that holds the data. A red note says building the repository inside get_service gives every request an empty store.">
    <text x="20" y="22" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>get_service: new each request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>get_service: mới ở mỗi request</tspan></text>
    {reqs.map((r) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={r.x} y="40" width="220" height="60" rx="10" class="box" />
        <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={r.x + 28} y={70} size={22} />
        <text x={r.x + 52} y="76" class="nm">CaseService</text>
        <text x={r.x + 110} y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.n.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.n.vi}</tspan></text>
        <line x1={r.x + 110} y1="132" x2={r.x + 110} y2="178" class="ln" />
        <polygon points={`${r.x + 110},192 ${r.x + 105},178 ${r.x + 115},178`} class="hd" />
      </g>
    ))}
    <rect x="200" y="196" width="500" height="62" rx="10" class="box red" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={236} y={227} size={24} />
    <text x="266" y="233" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>one in-memory repository</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một repository trong bộ nhớ</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="282" text-anchor="middle" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>get_repo with @lru_cache: built once, holds all the cases</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>get_repo với @lru_cache: dựng một lần, giữ mọi case</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="318" text-anchor="middle" class="rt"><tspan data-lang-en>build it inside get_service instead and every request sees an empty store: "not found"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dựng nó trong get_service thì mỗi request thấy kho rỗng: "not found"</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Two lifetimes in one wiring: the service is cheap and rebuilt per request, the repository holds the data and must outlive every request.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hai vòng đời trong một lần nối dây: service rẻ nên dựng lại mỗi request, repository giữ dữ liệu nên phải sống lâu hơn mọi request.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep4f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep4f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep4f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep4f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep4f .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep4f .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep4f .sm { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep4f .rt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; }
  .bep4f .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep4f .box.red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep4f .dash { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep4f .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep4f .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep4f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
